@* Static, outside the interactive circuit: these controls must work after the server exits. *@
<main id="desktop-app-stopped" class="desktop-stopped-page" hidden aria-labelledby="desktop-stopped-title">
    <h1 id="desktop-stopped-title">App stopped</h1>
    <p>SamsungController has quit. Your saved settings are kept.</p>
    <p>Your browser kept this tab open. Close it with <strong>⌘W</strong> on Mac or <strong>Ctrl+W</strong> on Windows/Linux.</p>
    <p>To continue using the controls, reopen the SamsungController app first, then click below.</p>
    <button type="button" class="toolbar-button" id="desktop-return-to-app">Return to app</button>
    <p id="desktop-return-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</main>
